== Equipment ==
*'''Armor'''
*5x Radiant Insignias
*Largest Vigor Rune you can afford
*2x Runes of Attunement

*'''Weapons'''
*Silencing Daggers of Defense with "I Have The Power!" Inscription (Silencing mod will extend Daze duration to 11 seconds)
*Zealous Daggers of Defense with "I Have The Power!" Inscription
== Usage ==
*Wait for an enemy group to ball up
*Apply {{skill icon|Critical Eye}} and {{skill icon|Critical Agility}}
*Select your target - A central caster enemy is ideal, but you'll be spreading Daze & Blind to the whole group
*Shadow Step to the enemy with {{skill icon|Beguiling Haze}}
*As soon as you've Stepped, use {{skill icon|Unseen Fury}}
*You can now choose to pop {{skill icon|Epidemic}} to spread Daze & Blind to the group of enemies
-or-
*You can use {{skill icon|Golden Lotus Strike}} followed by {{skill icon|Golden Fang Strike}} and then pop {{skill icon|Epidemic}} to spread Daze, Blind, and Deep Wound to the group
*Auto-attacking an enemy that is Dazed will provide constant interrupts of spells
*Blinded enemies cannot block your attacks, thanks to {{skill icon|Unseen Fury}}
*Cycle through the Dagger Attack chain until enemies are dead

== Counters ==
General melee counters, such as being Blinded, {{skill icon|Clumsiness}} or {{skill icon|Ineptitude}} being cast on you before you can spread Daze to the casters
== Notes ==
*This build benefits from having a {{skill icon|Psychic Instability}} hero to provide extended Knockdown of the entire group, allowing you to very easily apply all 3 conditions to the group
*This build also benefits from having an AoE snare provided by a hero, such as {{skill icon|Deep Freeze}}